+ * Full hardware acceleration:
+ *   - ARM SMMU MMU-500 stage 1 context banks (SID 5 GMU, SID 0 GPU)
+ *   - RSCC/PDC sleep/wake sequencers & RPMh communication
+ *   - GMU (Cortex-M4) firmware loading (ITCM/DTCM/icache/dcache)
+ *   - HFI v2 message queues (PERF_TABLE, BW_TABLE, CORE_FW_START, GX_BW_PERF_VOTE)
+ *   - OOB GPU_SET: GMU enables GX power domain & clocks
+ *   - GPU core registers, 64-bit addressing & SQE microcode loading
+ *   - PM4 packet generation with hardware parity bits
+ *   - TrustZone SCM PIL authentication for zap shader (PAS ID 13)
+ *   - CP_SET_SECURE_MODE (0) exit from secure mode
